    <h1 class="ind-h1">Water Management for<br><em>Condominium Associations &amp; Residential Portfolios.</em></h1>
    <p class="ind-sub">Condominium associations carry water costs in two categories that are both difficult to manage without systematic support: common area and amenity water (pools, irrigation, fitness, mechanical) and the administrative complexity of sub-meter billing across dozens or hundreds of residential units. WST audits both.</p>
